---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout locale="zh-HK" title="個人化你的 AI — Luxon Learn" description="最強大嘅 AI 設定只需 2 分鐘 — 但幾乎冇人用。">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/legacy-shared.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/learn/learn-styles.css" />
  </Fragment>

  <!-- Lesson Hero -->
  <section class="lesson-hero">
    <div class="lesson-breadcrumb">
      <a href="/zh-HK/learn">Learn</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span>第 3 課</span>
    </div>
    <div class="lesson-badge">Level 1</div>
    <h1>個人化你的 AI</h1>
    <p class="lesson-subtitle">最強大嘅 AI 設定只需 2 分鐘 — 但幾乎冇人用。</p>
  </section>

  <div class="lesson-content">

    <!-- Visual: Generic vs Personalized -->
    <div class="lesson-visual">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 640 280" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <!-- Generic response -->
        <rect x="20" y="20" width="280" height="240" rx="16" fill="#fef2f2" stroke="#fecaca"/>
        <text x="40" y="50" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#dc2626" font-weight="700">❌ 通用</text>
        <rect x="40" y="66" width="240" height="70" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#e5e7eb"/>
        <text x="52" y="86" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#6b7280">敬啟者，希望呢封電郵</text>
        <text x="52" y="100" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#6b7280">你一切都好。我寫信係想</text>
        <text x="52" y="114" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#6b7280">通知你……</text>
        <text x="40" y="160" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#9ca3af">正式。通用。冇個人感覺。</text>
        <text x="40" y="178" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#9ca3af">邊個寫嘅、寫畀邊個，睇唔出。</text>

        <!-- Personalized response -->
        <rect x="340" y="20" width="280" height="240" rx="16" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#bbf7d0"/>
        <text x="360" y="50" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#16a34a" font-weight="700">✓ 個人化</text>
        <rect x="360" y="66" width="240" height="70" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#86efac"/>
        <text x="372" y="86" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#3c4043">嘿！Q2 報告更新一下 —</text>
        <text x="372" y="100" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#3c4043">數字好靚。睇完記得</text>
        <text x="372" y="114" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#3c4043">覆我呀。</text>
        <text x="360" y="160" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#16a34a" font-weight="600">聽落就係你嘅聲音。完全配合你嘅風格。</text>
        <text x="360" y="178" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#16a34a" font-weight="600">AI 孥到咗你嘅語氣、職位同偏好。</text>

        <!-- Arrow -->
        <path d="M310 140 L330 140" stroke="#4285f4" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowhead3)"/>
        <defs><marker id="arrowhead3" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="6" refX="8" refY="3" orient="auto"><polygon points="0 0, 8 3, 0 6" fill="#4285f4"/></marker></defs>
      </svg>
      <p class="lesson-visual-caption">同樣嘅要求。冇個人化，你得到通用嘅答案。有嘅話，你得到屬於你嘅答案。</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Steps -->
    <div class="lesson-steps">
      <div class="lesson-step">
        <div class="lesson-step__number">1</div>
        <div class="lesson-step__content">
          <h3>咩係個人化？</h3>
          <p>自訂指令就好似 AI 嘅工作說明。話畀佢知你係邊個、做咩、想點樣做嘢 — 佢就會喺每一次回覆都跟住做。永久咁。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lesson-step">
        <div class="lesson-step__number">2</div>
        <div class="lesson-step__content">
          <h3>點樣設定</h3>
          <p><strong>Claude：</strong>開 Project Settings → 加你嘅指令。<br><strong>ChatGPT：</strong>Settings → Personalize → Custom Instructions。大約 2 分鐘就搞掂。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lesson-step">
        <div class="lesson-step__number">3</div>
        <div class="lesson-step__content">
          <h3>要填啲咩</h3>
          <p>你嘅職位同行業、鍾意嘅語氣（輕鬆定正式）、格式偏好（條列式、短段落）、同埋一定要避開嘅嘢。講得愈具體愈好 — 「我鍾意用條列式」遠勝過「簡潔啲」。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Compare -->
    <div class="lesson-compare">
      <div class="lesson-compare__box lesson-compare__box--bad">
        <div class="lesson-compare__label">之前</div>
        <p class="lesson-compare__text">"Write an email"</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lesson-compare__box lesson-compare__box--good">
        <div class="lesson-compare__label">個人化之後</div>
        <p class="lesson-compare__text">"Write a short email in my usual casual tone, under 200 words"</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tip -->
    <div class="lesson-tip">
      <div class="lesson-tip__icon">💡</div>
      <div class="lesson-tip__text"><strong>由呢度開始：</strong>打「幫我寫最好嘅自訂指令畀呢個專案」— 讓 AI 自己寫指令。佢比自己更清楚佢需要啲咩。</div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="lesson-cta">
      <h3>需要我們幫你設定嗎？</h3>
      <p>我們為你配置一切 — 個人化設定、專案和工作流程 — 一次搞定。</p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/85297381028" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">預約安裝</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Lesson Nav -->
  <div class="lesson-nav">
    <a href="/zh-HK/learn/lesson-2" class="prev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><path d="M19 12H5m7-7-7 7 7 7"/></svg> 先建立專案</a>
    <a href="/zh-HK/learn/lesson-4" class="next">複製貼上技巧 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><path d="M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
